# Embedded git repos (tracked separately)
openclaw/
# .github contains an embedded clone of the GitHub *profile* repo — ignore
# that noise specifically, NOT the whole directory: workflows/ must be
# trackable or CI files can never be committed (this bit us until 2026-07-25).
.github/.git/
.github/profile/
.github/README.md
.github/copilot-instructions.md

# Large raw game asset dumps (binary files, not source code)
pixel game stuff/
pixel-game/
pixel-office-game/

